  - q: "Why does the calculator show different results for AM and PM inputs?"
    a: "The calculator uses 24-hour time internally. If you enter 3:00 and mean 3 PM you should enter 15:00 in 24-hour format. Alternatively use the AM and PM selectors if they appear for your input. Getting AM and PM wrong is the most common source of errors in manual time calculations."
